  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Use a Virgin Hub 5 router (On latest firmware) (LG-RDK_4.6.24-2206.7)\n\n2. Open up VRC and join a world using RTSP\n\n3. Wait up to 5 minutes\n\n4. Router disconnects from the internet (Router reboots due to Kernel Panic)\n\n5. VRC Disconnects from world\n\nI'm not sure if this is something VRC can mitigate or help prevent but Virgin Media do not seem to have any interest in fixing this issue.\n\nMore info and replication steps outside of VRC can be found here:\n\nhttps://community.virginmedia.com/t5/Networking-and-WiFi/Hub-5-crashes-from-RTSP-stream/td-p/5307855/highlight/false\n\nhttps://community.virginmedia.com/t5/Gaming-Support/Connection-issues-with-VRChat-RG-crash-Packet-loss/td-p/5303479\n\nhttps://community.virginmedia.com/t5/Gaming-Support/SYNC-Timing-Synchronization-failure-while-in-vr/td-p/5291040",
